{"id":"da818d16195851b8","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-lattice-nondist.md","title":"c.e. 集合格满足分配律：旧标题订正","display":"thm-lattice-nondist — c.e. 集合格满足分配律：旧标题订正","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-lattice-nondist","aliases":["20-thm-lattice-nondist"],"display":"thm-lattice-nondist — c.e. 集合格满足分配律：旧标题订正","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"§2.1.7；集合分配恒等式","source_pdf_pages":[63],"source_printed_pages":[27],"depends_on":["[[20-df-lattice-ops]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-lattice-nondist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-lattice-nondist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lattice-nondist — c.e. 集合格满足分配律：旧标题订正"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§2.1.7；集合分配恒等式"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3d365fa2f7a9d0f\" href=\"?note=c3d365fa2f7a9d0f\" title=\"20-df-lattice-ops\">20-df-lattice-ops</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3d365fa2f7a9d0f\" href=\"?note=c3d365fa2f7a9d0f\" title=\"20-df-lattice-ops\">20-df-lattice-ops</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}nondist}\\vdash\nA\\cap(B\\cup C)=(A\\cap B)\\cup(A\\cap C),\\qquad\nA\\cup(B\\cap C)=(A\\cup B)\\cap(A\\cup C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}nondist}\\vdash\nA\\cap(B\\cup C)=(A\\cap B)\\cup(A\\cap C),\\qquad\nA\\cup(B\\cap C)=(A\\cup B)\\cap(A\\cup C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐元素使用布尔逻辑即可证明；商格也满足这些等式。原断言声称存在违反集合分配恒等式的 c.e. 三元组，错误。保留标识 nondist 以维护链接，正文准确改为 distributive，不能把 c.e. 度的非格性质移给 c.e. 集合格。</p>\n<p>来源：§2.1.7；集合分配恒等式；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-lattice-ops","status":"resolved","id":"c3d365fa2f7a9d0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lattice-ops]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-ops","status":"resolved","id":"c3d365fa2f7a9d0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lattice-ops]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}nondist}\\vdash\nA\\cap(B\\cup C)=(A\\cap B)\\cup(A\\cap C),\\qquad\nA\\cup(B\\cap C)=(A\\cup B)\\cap(A\\cup C).","display":true}],"bytes":1203,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c3d365fa2f7a9d0f"]}